{"id":"detalle","lemma":"detalle","pos":"noun","rank":1097,"glosses":["detail","nice gesture, beau geste, attention","small gift"],"ipa":"/deˈtaʝe/","gender":"m","forms":{"plural":"detalles"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/6/6d/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-detalle.wav","examples":[{"text":"Ése fue un detalle bonito.","en":"That was a nice touch.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301994"},{"text":"¿Podría dar más detalles?","en":"Could you elaborate?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/449210"},{"text":"Se lo explicó con detalle.","en":"He explained it in detail.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/587381"},{"text":"Aquí tenéis algunos detalles.","en":"Here are some details.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/301746"},{"text":"¿Lo podrías explicar con más detalle?","en":"Would you explain it in more detail?","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/531671"}]}